# jig: line endings of the framework's own files, whatever core.autocrlf says.
# Scoped to what jig itself places and hashes byte for byte — never
# .ai/knowledge/, .ai/specs/ or .ai/workspace/, which hold a project's own
# prose and are free to keep whatever line endings that project uses.
.ai/manifest text eol=lf
.ai/scripts/** text eol=lf
.ai/profiles/** text eol=lf
.ai/templates/** text eol=lf
.claude/skills/** text eol=lf
.codex/skills/** text eol=lf
